      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Wastewater is water generated after the use of freshwater, raw water, drinking water or saline water in various applications or processes. It can also refer to other types of water, such as industrial, cooling, leachate, surface runoff, and agricultural wastewater. Wastewater treatment is the removal of impurities from wastewater before it reaches aquifers or natural bodies of water.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "废水是在各种应用或工艺中使用淡水、原水、饮用水或盐水后产生的水。它也可以指其他类型的水，如工业废水、冷却水、沥滤液、地表径流和农业废水。废水处理是指在废水到达含水层或天然水体之前去除其中的杂质。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
